    "detailed_description": "Enter the world of &quot;Cerebral Clash,&quot; a multiplayer arcade tank shooter with a brainy twist. Control a brain-topped tank and engage in thrilling battles against other brain-powered tanks. With a captivating single-player campaign and exciting multiplayer modes, this game offers intense strategic warfare. Upgrade your tank, customize its appearance, and prove your mettle on the battlefield. Are you ready to outsmart your opponents in this unique tank shooter? Download &quot;Cerebral Clash&quot; now and immerse yourself in epic battles that challenge your wits and reflexes!",
